{
  "name": "short-cross-language-regression-v1",
  "frozen": false,
  "comment": "Non-frozen regression suite for short ambiguous English queries against Chinese note lines. It contains cases used while designing short-query rescue and must not be treated as the final blind holdout. Bare terms require top 3; contextual variants require top 1.",
  "queries": [
